Zou Shoumin, director of the Environmental Supervision Bureau of the Ministry of Environmental Protection of China, introduced in Beijing on the 22nd that in August, a total of 57 consecutive daily punishment cases were implemented nationwide, and the newly revised "Environmental Protection Law" implemented at the beginning of this year significantly increased China's environmental enforcement efforts.
At present, environmental protection agencies in various parts of China can use punishment methods such as daily continuous punishment, seizure and seizure, production restriction and transfer to administrative detention to investigate and punish environmental violations, and cooperate with judicial organs to punish environmental crimes.
Zou Shoumin introduced that in August, a total of 335 cases were seized and detained in various parts of China; a total of 177 cases were closed and discontinued; a total of 189 cases of administrative detention were transferred, and 166 cases of suspected environmental pollution crimes were transferred.
Among them, Henan has implemented 7 consecutive daily penalties, and at present, China is embedding from the end control to the whole process to comprehensively increase environmental pollution control.
Although the downward pressure on the economy appears, China's Ministry of Environmental Protection has clearly stated that China should correctly handle the positioning of environmental protection in economic development, enhance the "green determination", the more the economic growth is downward, the more you can't relax environmental protection, and play a good role in optimizing environmental protection for the economy.
There is no highest, only higher, Guizhou Moutai stock price can not stop on the road to a new high.
On January 9, the A-share "King of Shares" Guizhou Moutai's stock price once again reached a record high, as of closing at 782.52 yuan, with a total market value of 983 billion yuan, just one step away from the trillion market value.
The guidance price of 1,499 yuan increased by 200 yuan compared with the previous retail price of 1,299 yuan.
On December 28, 2017, Guizhou Maotai issued a notice saying that after a research decision, it was decided to appropriately raise the price of Maotai wine products from 2018, with an average increase of about 18%.
The price increase stimulated the stock price of Maotai in Guizhou, and the statistics of the reporter of the Beijing Morning News found that since the eight trading days announced by Guizhou Moutai's price increase news, Guizhou Moutai's stock price has risen 95 yuan, an increase of more than 14%.
According to statistics, the GDP of Guizhou Province in the 1-3 quarters of 2017 was 950 billion yuan, and the market value of Maotai Province will be far behind the GDP of Guizhou Province in the first three quarters of last year.
Driven by Moutai, liquor listed companies have opened the rhythm of raising prices and controlling goods, enjoying the dividends brought about by consumption upgrading.
Since 2017, the stock prices of most liquor listed companies have continued to rise sharply, among which the stock prices of Shuijingfang, Wufan Liquid, Shanxi Fenjiu and Guizhou Moutai have increased by more than doubled.
