On December 1, General Secretary of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and President Xi Jinping delivered a keynote speech at the opening ceremony of the high-level dialogue between the Communist Party of China and world political parties.
The future and destiny of the peoples of the world are becoming more and more closely linked.
The peoples of the world should adhere to each other's concept and understand each other.
Representatives of foreign political parties attending the dialogue highly agreed with Xi Jinping's proposal to promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind and work together to build a better world.
According to
This shows the determination and responsibility of the Chinese Communist Party to build a better world.
Striving to make our planet, which we were born and grew up, into a family of harmony, and to turn the aspirations of the peoples of the world for a better life into reality.
Facing the leaders of nearly 300 political parties and political organizations around the world, Xi Jinping comprehensively and systematically expounded the profound connotation of the community of human destiny.
Xi Jinping pointed out that the world pattern is changing and the development pattern is changing.
All political parties must conform to the trend of development of the times, and develop themselves with the development of the country, the nation and mankind.
As always contributing to the common development of the world, as always, we have contributed to the exchange and mutual learning of world civilizations.
Xi Jinping's speech clearly demonstrated China's commitment to building a community with a shared future for mankind, demonstrating the feelings and responsibility of the Chinese Communist Party as the world's largest political party.
In his speech, Li Keqiang said that at the Astana summit in June this year, President Xi Jinping and all parties reached important consensus on consolidating unity and mutual trust, strengthening security cooperation, docking development strategies, and deepening people-to-people and cultural exchanges.
After the summit, China took over the rotating presidency.
With the active support of all parties, we will promote the steady development of cooperation in various fields.
Li Keqiang put forward the following suggestions on building a community with a shared future for regional countries.
The first is to create a safe and stable regional environment.
The second is to accelerate cooperation in the integration of development strategies.
Development is an effective way to deal with regional conflicts and geopolitical instability.
Third, increase the level of trade liberalization and facilitation
We will steadily promote trade liberalization and facilitation, and accelerate the negotiation and signing of the SCO Trade Facilitation Agreement.
The fourth is to build a fast and convenient connection pattern.
Fifth, promote the in-depth development of production capacity and innovation cooperation.
The sixth is to strengthen the ties of people-to-people and cultural exchanges and cooperation.
Li Keqiang stressed that since the beginning of this year, China's economy has shifted to a high-quality development stage, which will bring new opportunities for cooperation between China and the SCO countries.
China will connect its own development with the development of regional countries and integrate its own security with regional national security.
