After the welcoming ceremony, Li Keqiang and Trudeau held the second annual dialogue between Chinese and Canadian prime ministers.
Li Keqiang Positively Appraised the Development of China-Canada Relations in the past year
Li Keqiang said that the current economic globalization continues to advance, and a new round of scientific and technological and industrial revolution has swept the world.
If China-Canada relations are to continue to develop healthily and steadily, it is necessary to conform to the trend of the times.
Adhere to mutual respect, equal treatment, mutual benefit and win-win results, and constantly expand common interests.
Li Keqiang pointed out that China-Canada practical cooperation is complementary, and it is necessary to expand two-way trade and investment and encourage enterprises of the two countries to invest in each other's countries.
Li Keqiang stressed that it is in line with the common interests of both sides to send a positive signal on the issue of promoting the liberalization and facilitation of trade and investment.
China's door to the outside world will open more and wider, and the business environment will get better and better, and it will continue to be a hot spot for international investment.
Continuation of friendship between the two countries
The Canadian side supports free trade and is willing to work with China to promote globalization and free trade and contribute to global sustainable development.
The two sides also exchanged views on international and regional issues of common concern.
After the talks, the prime ministers of the two countries jointly witnessed the signing of bilateral cooperation documents in the fields of education, food safety and energy.
On the afternoon of the 4th, Li Keqiang and Canadian Prime Minister Trudeau jointly met with reporters.
Li Keqiang introduced the results of the second annual dialogue between Chinese and Canadian prime ministers.
He said that the two sides agreed to promote the process of globalization, maintain trade and investment liberalization and facilitation, and are willing to work together to explore the feasibility of the China-Canada Free Trade Agreement.
China is open to the negotiation process and content.
The two sides agreed to strengthen tourism and aviation cooperation and strengthen people-to-people and cultural exchanges between the two countries.
Sharing opportunities, facing challenges together, and promoting China-Canada relations in the golden stage continue to shine brightly.
Deepen cooperation in various fields, commit to common development and prosperity, and build long-term stable and active relations between Canada and China.
Chairman of the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress Zhang Dejiang No. 4 attended and spoke at the Fourth National Constitution Day Symposium.
He stressed the need for in-depth study and implementation of Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era.
As the top priority of learning and implementing the spirit of the 19th National Congress of the Party, the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core is to strengthen the implementation and supervision of the Constitution.
More firmly and conscientiously adhere to the principles of the Constitution, carry forward the spirit of the Constitution, fulfill the mission of the Constitution, and give better play to the Constitution to build a well-off society in an all-round way.
It plays an important role in building a modern socialist country in an all-round way.
Zhang Dejiang pointed out that the Constitution is the fundamental law of the country and the general charter governing Anbang.
It is a concentrated manifestation of the will of the party and the people. We must vigorously carry forward the spirit of the Constitution, fully implement the Constitution, and unswervingly adhere to the leadership of the Communist Party of China.
Firmly safeguard the core position of General Secretary Xi Jinping, firmly safeguard the authority and centralized and unified leadership of the Party Central Committee, and unswervingly adhere to socialism with Chinese characteristics.
Transfiguration into conscious action of the entire population
Zhang Dejiang stressed that carrying out in-depth constitutional publicity and education is an important basic work to comprehensively promote the rule of law, and it is also a long-term task.
It is necessary to continue to give full play to the role of an important grasp such as national Constitution Day activities and constitutional oaths, and adopt more ways that the people like to see.
Carry out constitutional publicity and education, strive to improve the rule of law literacy of the whole nation, and build a solid ideological foundation and create a good social environment for promoting the implementation of constitutional laws.
Establish a constitutional consciousness, enhance constitutional self-confidence, and become a firm believer in the Constitution, preachers, practitioners and defenders of the Constitution.
Li Jianguo attended the symposium.
Wang Chen presided over the symposium.
According to the 2017 Fortune Global Forum will be held in Guangzhou from December 6th to 8th, and Vice Premier of the State Council Wang Yang will attend the opening ceremony of the forum.
He also delivered a keynote speech.
During this period, Deputy Prime Minister Wang Yang will meet with Canadian Prime Minister Justin Trudeau and Papua New Guinea Prime Minister O'Neill attending the forum.
