Promote the study and implementation of the spirit of the 19th National Congress of the Communist Party of China and Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and inspire and encourage the vast number of cadres and the masses to use the great spirit.
Promote great practice, never forget the original intention, keep in mind the mission, always struggle, and make unremitting efforts to realize the tasks put forward by the 19th National Congress of the Party.
