The reporter recently learned that the benefits of steel, rail transit, ships, machinery manufacturing and other industries in the northeast region have generally declined, and even suffered losses.
Some experts believe that under the current situation, the new round of revitalization of the northeast industry is not only related to the current round of national economic recovery, but also has an impact on the long-term development of China's manufacturing industry and international competitiveness, so there is an urgent need to adjust the transformation.
The general decline in the efficiency of enterprises in the traditional industry is more likely to have a serious decline in the benefits of raw material industry and heavy machinery and equipment manufacturing industry, and even a loss, which is the first performance of the Northeast industry in the current round of economic downturn.
In the past, in the economic downturn, it is mainly the characteristics of low-end and primary products that have been greatly affected, but in this economic fluctuation, the traditional high-end and low-end industrial products in the northeast have been affected.
In the past few years, Angang Group (Weibo) started from the adjustment of product structure, focusing on the development of high-end plates such as container plates, steel rails, shipboards and civil home appliances, but sales of these varieties have dropped significantly this year, especially the sales volume of ship plates fell by 50% compared with the same period last year.
Hao Qingshun, director of the metallurgical department of the Liaoning Provincial Industry and Information Commission, said that metallurgy is Liaoning's third pillar industry, with an annual output of 60 million tons of steel production capacity ranked third in the country.
From January to May this year, the output of crude steel in Liaoning Province was 21.54 million tons, and the production and marketing situation of products required by national policies and projects with strong construction by local governments was better, and the decline of products with fierce market competition was relatively large, which was another feature of the manufacturing industry in the northeast.
