Carry out in-depth exchanges of experience and mutual learning between governance and legislative supervision, and ensure the smooth development of cooperation in the fields of the construction of the Belt and Road Initiative and the docking of the Eurasian Economic Union from the legislative level.
Strengthen local cooperation and people-to-people and cultural exchanges, and inject new vitality and new momentum into China-Russia relations.
Medvedev said that he congratulated on the closing of the victory of the 19th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
Russia-China relations are progressing well, and cooperation has yielded fruitful results.
