If a timely umbrella is handed over on a rainy day, it will also allow tourists to better experience the style of the town.
In this sharing era, Zhebao Group's tourism all-media center has joined forces with the hottest shared umbrella company to customize a number of "poetry Zhejiang" version of the shared umbrella, hoping to advocate the concept of "sharing green", enhance the civilized tourism awareness and virtue of tourists and small town residents, and create a beautiful tourism environment.
