The main reason why the tourist town is attractive lies in its original taste.
The beauty of a tourist town is not only due to the flow of small bridges, but also from a long-standing cultural tradition; rural revitalization stems from cultural self-confidence.
Throughout the world, the small town of Liser in the Netherlands, the town of Halstadt in Austria, and the small town of Pumpkin in France, with tulips, "salt" and pumpkin as the core attractions, attract a large number of tourists from all over the world every year, and realize tourism to boost the town's economy.
For the style town, the focus of "highlighting the characteristics and retaining nostalgia" makes the town have obvious personality and soul, but also provides cultural infiltration, carries the local context, and highlights the local civilization.
The tourist town, with culture and nostalgia as the link, with humanities and scenery as the carrier, connects the four tourists, so that the traditional style and culture are inherited and innovated in co-construction and sharing.
In essence, the tourist town is a complex and open tourist scenic spot, which should also be a shared living space for local residents and foreign tourists and even travelers.
As the main battlefield for the growth of tourism in the future, the town of tourism is not only likely to change the appearance of rural ecology, the mode of economic and social development, and the direction of the flow of industrial factors, but also an important force for eliminating the gap between urban and rural infrastructure and awakening the recovery of rural culture.
