The second is to promote mobile payment services to foreign merchants through the consumption behavior of Chinese tourists abroad, thereby changing the perception and acceptance of Chinese mobile payment in foreign countries.
In fact, the Chinese get to heaven.
China's rapid economic development, coupled with a large population base, Chinese tourists spending in Europe is an attractive figure.
However, it is also destined, and the Chinese mobile payment war that opened in Germany is not expected.
WeChat Pay and Alipay just moved the battlefield to Europe, the competitors have not changed, and the position of robbing has not changed - or the Chinese, this is also globalization?
