The escalation of the battle for fresh supermarkets has become a phenomenal topic in the field of new retail, where is the new retail?
"In 2018, we will quickly enter the whole country, and before the Spring Festival in Beijing, Shanghai, Hangzhou will open a lot of stores."
Hou Yi, CEO of Koma Fresh, revealed the "new style of play" in 2018 at the second new retail summit on the 10th.
"Starting from 2018 onwards, Box Horse is not just a fresh electricity supplier, but to meet consumers' real-time services.
The core model offline is drainage and experience, and online is the real sales."
Different from the traditional hypermarkets and supermarkets, Box Horse Fresh in the eyes of many consumers is a fun and delicious "net red shop", and even an intermediary agency played out the concept of "box room".
Online e-commerce platforms and offline retailers have their own advantages and disadvantages, but consumers are appearing in a variety of channels, so both sides are experimenting with omni-channel models.
The industry believes that under the background of consumption upgrading, there will be more and more stores of "box horses" in 2018.
From the beginning of the fresh to continue to explore more areas of consumption, indicating that in the new year, there will be more innovations in the retail market.
"For example, the combination of online and offline business models has attracted the attention of consumers, and fresh supermarkets from all over the world are called and praised."
"But these relationships say no more, it's not useful anymore, and finally it's implemented if you bring a good experience to consumers, and I'm willing to pay."
In the view of Yuan Bin, co-cEO of Darun Fafei, in the new retail environment, consumer habits have changed, and purchase demand has also changed.
It turns out that pure online and offline are divided, the line is to beat the line, the online counter-offensive line, is now holding hands together, because there is no distinction between online and offline consumers.
The scrambling of capital to enter the market makes the new retail gunpowder currently represented by fresh supermarkets.
According to the analysis, at present, the competition of new retail in first-tier cities is far from the pattern of the Red Sea, and there are still large second-tier cities that have yet to be explored, and there is still a lot of opportunity and space in the market.
Different types of industries for the layout of new retail, will bring the development of new retail into a diversified state of development.
