Among them, the online retail sales of physical goods are nearly 5.08 trillion yuan, and the online retail sales of services are nearly 1.49 trillion yuan.
The proportion of total retail sales of social goods reached 13.6%, an increase of nearly 3 percentage points year-on-year.
