The U.S. has changed its green card rules.
The media quoted President Donald Trump as saying that the United States will launch a new immigration program and modify the green card regulations.
The program is intended to reduce the number of legal immigrants to 50,000 per year, and temporary work visas and family-oriented visa applications will be subject to stricter restrictions.
The new rules were proposed by Republicans and supported by the president.
The draft law will be discussed in both chambers.
U.S. media quoted Trump as saying, "This law will reduce poverty, raise wages, save taxpayers billions of dollars, and achieve these benefits by changing the way the United States issues green cards to citizens of other countries."
The law will replace the current scheme to reduce chain migration.
This new application process benefits applicants who speak English, have financial support, and have skills conducive to economic development.”
On May 29, the first China Fireworks and Firecrackers Safety and Environmental Protection Expo will be held in Liuyang.
The event revolved around the theme of "science and technology, safety and environmental protection" for a period of two days. At that time, the most advanced flower cannon machinery, the safest and most environmentally friendly flower cannon raw auxiliary materials and new products in the national fireworks and firecracker industry will gather in Liuyang.
The expo will invite a large number of experts and entrepreneurs to carry out academic exchanges in the fireworks industry and share the latest technological achievements of fireworks and firecracker safety and environmental protection.
Among them, fireworks and firecrackers mechanized production equipment and safety and environmental protection products display will be carried out in Dayao Town, the main exhibition projects include mature technology, relevant scientific and technological identification and safety demonstration of fireworks and firecrackers production of pharmaceutical-related machinery and equipment, low sensitivity, low explosive energy and other safe-type fireworks, no sulfur, micro-smoke and other safe and environmentally friendly personal combustion products.
At the same time, by Liuyang 16 fireworks enterprises collectively hosted by the fireworks and firecrackers safety and environmental protection product release display is divided into two stages of product selection and product release display, through the early selection of outstanding new products will be on the evening of May 29 in Liuyang City flower cannon viewing platform and Jintan ignition display display.
