Among the red card enterprises proposed for evaluation, there are more heavy polluting enterprises such as electroplating, printing and dyeing, and prevention and control, and some sewage treatment plants are also on the list.
The Provincial Environmental Protection Department said that in order to reflect the principles of openness, fairness and fairness and accept public supervision, the rating results will now be publicized on the website of the Environmental Protection Department.
