Neighbors also said that it was difficult to see rich trees blooming. Residents of the community thought that this was an auspicious thing, and when they learned that they were very happy to come and watch.
"Maraba chestnut" is a tropical plant, native to Mexico, happy warm and humid, must be suitable for sunlight, moisture, nutrients and other conditions are suitable for the possibility of flowering phenomenon.
Even in the field, which is suitable for tropical conditions, it is rare for rich trees to bloom, and there has been a saying that "the flowering rate is only one thousandth".
Yesterday morning, the reporter came to the dormitory of the Democracy Road Machinery Hall in Nanning City, and under the guidance of Aunt Gao, the reporter saw the rich tree.
The rich tree is planted in the flower garden of the community, about 5 meters high, and the thickest branches are about 30 centimeters long, and the leaves are green and lush.
The flowers bloom at the top of the higher branches, the blooming flowers are more than 10 centimeters wide, the light yellow filaments are evenly scattered, and the green buds are curled on both sides after cracking, and the flowers are as fine as silver wire, and the filament Venus points.
Aunt Gao told reporters that this rich tree has been planted for 8 years, when it was about 1 meter high, and now it is more than 5 meters long.
This is her son's bonsai purchased from the flower and bird market, and later planted in the flower garden, she did not take good care of it, that is, it is only sometimes cultivated soil.
