"Sichuan-made" new energy vehicles against the trend of fiscal subsidies weakened, charging facilities penetration rate is not high, ternary lithium batteries suspended in the use of new energy buses, in the face of the current upward pressure in the domestic new energy vehicle market
From November 3rd to 6th, in the first phase of the 16th Western China International Expo (hereinafter referred to as the "Western Expo") exhibition, Chengdu, Nanchong, Ya'an and other six cities and states have demonstrated their development achievements in advanced manufacturing, among which new energy vehicles are well-known, and new products aroused, which has aroused widespread concern in the industry.
At present, with the weakening of financial subsidies for new energy vehicles, the low penetration rate of charging facilities, and the suspension of ternary lithium batteries on the use of new energy buses, there will be temporary upward pressure in the domestic new energy vehicle market.
However, "Sichuan-made" new energy vehicles are bucking the trend and enter the market segments of passenger cars and commercial vehicles.
The current situation of this reporter Zhao Zeyu: focus on cultivating the new energy vehicle industry news of "Sichuan made" in the near future.
